# Frontend conventions

## Pages

- `BuilderPage` — owner gate + accordion form (Profile / Sources / FAQ)
- `ChatPage` — `/a/:agentId` recruiter chat with starter chips

## Accordion

- Track open state per section independently (`Record<Section, boolean>`)
- **Always keep field panels in the DOM**; toggle with `hidden={!open}` — never `{open && <inputs/>}` (unmount clears values and file inputs)

## Chat UX

- Keep message `<input>` enabled while `busy` (only disable Send / guard `ask()`)
- `inputRef.focus()` after send completes and when agent loads
- Dark minimal theme: `#0b0d10` bg, `#eceff3` text, `#7eb6ff` accent; Manrope + Newsreader
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`; visible `:focus-visible` rings

## API client

- Owner mutations: `X-Owner-Secret` from `sessionStorage` (`api.ts`)
- After UI changes that matter in Docker: `npm run build` in `frontend/` then `docker compose up --build`
